      "title": "Remove background: a transparent PNG with BiRefNet",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Remove background: a transparent PNG with BiRefNet\n\nFinds the subject of your image with a BiRefNet model and saves the image with everything behind the subject made transparent. The model file is an input, so the same graph runs BiRefNet and Lucida. Built from Comfy's template utility_birefnet_remove_background.\n\n## Models\n\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors): BiRefNet, by ZhengPeng7, [MIT](https://huggingface.co/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
